  "notes": "COMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {縞|しま}{模様|もよう}: striped pattern\n- {縦縞|たてじま}: vertical stripes\n- {横縞|よこじま}: horizontal stripes\n- {縞|しま}のある: striped (modifying a noun)\n\nNOTE: Often combines with a direction or pattern word: {縦縞|たてじま}, {横縞|よこじま}, {太|ふと}い{縞|しま} (wide stripes). The homophone {島|しま} (00885) means island.",
